{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VvZqtTN6XUspgLckbxGghN","type":"tool_result","content":"---\ntitle: Task\ntype: schema\npermalink: main/schemas/task\nentity: Task\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  description: string, what needs to be done\n  status?(enum, current state):\n  - active\n  - blocked\n  - done\n  - abandoned\n  assigned_to?: string, who is working on this\n  steps?(array): string, ordered steps to complete\n  current_step?: integer, which step number we're on (1-indexed)\n  context?: string, key context needed to resume after memory loss\n  started?: string, when work began\n  completed?: string, when work finished\n  blockers?(array): string, what's preventing progress\n---\ntitle: Coding Session\ntype: schema\npermalink: main/schemas/coding-session\nentity: CodingSession\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  summary?: string, one-paragraph what happened in this coding session\n  changed_file?(array): string, files created, edited, deleted, or inspected\n  verification?(array): string, checks run and their result\n  decision?(array): string, decisions surfaced or created during the session\n  blocker?(array): string, unresolved blockers or failed approaches\n│\n└  Done!  Review skills before use; they run with full agent permissions.\n\nnpm notice\nnpm notice New major version of npm available! 11.19.1 -> 12.2.1\nnpm notice Changelog: https://github.com/npm/cli/releases/tag/v12.2.1\nnpm notice To update run: npm install -g npm@12.2.1\nnpm notice","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"334cb0fd-67e5-478c-a6f7-e6636921ecfb","uuid":"49b3d82f-4e70-482a-b3df-40c5c530d094","timestamp":"2026-11-03T18:20:01.799Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"---\ntitle: Task\ntype: schema\npermalink: main/schemas/task\nentity: Task\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  description: string, what needs to be done\n  status?(enum, current state):\n  - active\n  - blocked\n  - done\n  - abandoned\n  assigned_to?: string, who is working on this\n  steps?(array): string, ordered steps to complete\n  current_step?: integer, which step number we're on (1-indexed)\n  context?: string, key context needed to resume after memory loss\n  started?: string, when work began\n  completed?: string, when work finished\n  blockers?(array): string, what's preventing progress\n---\ntitle: Coding Session\ntype: schema\npermalink: main/schemas/coding-session\nentity: CodingSession\nversion: 1\nschema:\n  summary?: string, one-paragraph what happened in this coding session\n  changed_file?(array): string, files created, edited, deleted, or inspected\n  verification?(array): string, checks run and their result\n  decision?(array): string, decisions surfaced or created during the session\n  blocker?(array): string, unresolved blockers or failed approaches\n│\n└  Done!  Review skills before use; they run with full agent permissions.\n\nnpm notice\nnpm notice New major version of npm available! 11.19.1 -> 12.2.1\nnpm notice Changelog: https://github.com/npm/cli/releases/tag/v12.2.1\nnpm notice To update run: npm install -g npm@12.2.1\nnpm notice","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VvZqtTN6XUspgLckbxGghN","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
